<title>SPAIN: Spain's April Treasury account up 1.126 tln pta.</title>
<headline>Spain's April Treasury account up 1.126 tln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Treasury's account with the Bank of Spain rose by 1.126 billion pesetas in the month of April to a total of 2.92 trillion pesetas, the Economy Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday Treasury director Jaime Caruana said that account was standing at around three trillion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
